@startuml seq_billing
title Increment 8 - Billing and Simulated Payments

autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Guest
actor Receptionist
participant "Booking Service (Inc. 5)" as BK
participant "Staff UI" as UI
participant "Billing API" as API
participant "Folio Service" as FS
participant "Pricing Service" as PS
participant "Invoice Service" as IS
participant "Simulated Payment Service" as PAY
database "Hotel Database" as DB

== Mandatory Booking Payment (shared with Increment 5) ==

Guest -> BK: Pay for active Pending hold (holdId, attemptId)
BK -> API: Record booking payment (reservationId, amount, attemptId)
API -> DB: Find payment by attemptId
DB --> API: Existing / not found
alt attemptId already processed
    API --> BK: Return original result (no duplicate charge)
else New attempt
    API -> PAY: Process simulated payment
    PAY --> API: Successful / Failed
    API -> DB: Save payment_transaction (type=Booking, status, attemptId)
    API --> BK: Outcome
end
note over API,DB
  Failed attempts are recorded and the hold stays Pending.
  Confirmation is only allowed for a Successful payment.
end note

== Reversal of Unusable Payment ==

BK -> API: Payment succeeded but hold expired / commit failed
API -> PAY: Reverse simulated payment
alt Reversal successful
    PAY --> API: Reversed
    API -> DB: Save reversal (status=Reversed, linked to original)
else Reversal failed or unknown
    PAY --> API: Failed / unknown
    API -> DB: Mark original NeedsReconciliation
end

== Folio Creation (at check-in) ==

Receptionist -> UI: Open checked-in stay
UI -> API: Request folio (reservationId, stayId)
API -> API: Check staff role and permission
API -> FS: Create or retrieve folio
FS -> DB: Find folio by reservation
DB --> FS: Existing / not found

alt Folio does not exist
    FS -> PS: Build accommodation charges from price snapshot
    PS -> DB: Retrieve price snapshot, check-in and check-out dates
    DB --> PS: Nightly rate snapshot and dates
    PS -> PS: nights x nightly rate
    FS -> DB: Create folio (Open) with accommodation charge,\nattach prior successful booking payments as credits
    DB --> FS: Folio created
end
FS --> API: Folio details with balance
API --> UI: Display folio

== Extra Charges ==

Receptionist -> UI: Add extra charge
UI -> API: Submit description, quantity, unit price, requestId
API -> API: Check staff role
API -> FS: Validate and add extra charge
FS -> DB: Check folio is Open and requestId not already used
DB --> FS: Folio state / duplicate check

alt Folio closed, invalid quantity or price, or duplicate requestId
    FS --> API: Reject
    API --> UI: Display error
else Valid
    FS -> DB: Save itemized charge, write audit record
    DB --> FS: Saved
    FS --> API: Updated folio
    API --> UI: Display updated folio
end

== Tax and Invoice ==

Receptionist -> UI: Generate invoice
UI -> API: Request invoice
API -> PS: Calculate invoice totals
PS -> DB: Retrieve folio charges and tax configuration
DB --> PS: Charges and configured tax rate
PS -> PS: subtotal = sum of lines;\ntax = round_half_up(subtotal x rate, 3);\ntotal = subtotal + tax
note over PS
  Currency is JOD, 3 decimal places.
  Tax rate is configurable.
  Tax is computed once on the subtotal, not per line.
end note
PS --> API: Totals
API -> IS: Generate itemized invoice
IS -> DB: Save invoice with line-item snapshot and invoice number
DB --> IS: Invoice saved
IS --> API: Invoice details
API --> UI: Display invoice, paid amount and balance due

== Additional Simulated Payment ==

Receptionist -> UI: Record payment
UI -> API: Submit amount, method, attemptId
API -> API: Validate amount > 0 and attemptId not used
API -> PAY: Process simulated payment

alt Payment successful
    PAY --> API: Success and transaction reference
    API -> DB: Save payment (Successful), write audit record
    API --> UI: Display payment and updated balance
else Payment failed
    PAY --> API: Failed
    API -> DB: Save payment (Failed)
    API --> UI: Display failure
end

== Refund ==

Receptionist -> UI: Request refund (reservationId, reason)
UI -> API: Submit refund request, requestId
API -> API: Check staff role
API -> PS: Determine refund eligibility
PS -> DB: Load reservation, check-in time, payments, prior refunds
DB --> PS: Data
PS -> PS: Apply cancellation policy (24 h before 14:00 check-in);\nrefundable = paid - already refunded

alt Not eligible or amount is zero
    PS --> API: Refund 0.000 JOD with reason
    API --> UI: Display no-refund result
else Eligible
    API -> PAY: Process simulated refund against original payment
    alt Refund successful
        PAY --> API: Refunded
        API -> DB: Save refund (Successful), write audit record
        API --> UI: Display refund confirmation
    else Refund failed
        PAY --> API: Failed / unknown
        API -> DB: Save refund (NeedsReconciliation)
        API --> UI: Display failure
    end
end

== Check-out (hook from Increment 7) ==

Receptionist -> UI: Check out stay
UI -> API: Finalize folio (stayId)
API -> FS: Close folio
FS -> DB: Add any early/late checkout charge, set Closed
DB --> FS: Closed, balance
FS --> API: Final folio
API --> UI: Show balance due or settled

@enduml